# ::tok Personally , I think it 's acceptable , firstly , the price is cheap , and more than 700 pages are divided into two , and it is better to read as a paperback ; Second , unlike Michelangelo 's complete works , paintings account for the main body , Leonardo da Vinci 's black - and - white manuscript accounts for the majority , and for non - art readers with limited budgets , this edition is the most cost - effective for viewing paintings and manuscripts .
